+  ADefs --> ACpp[A2UI ExtendedStyleResolver.ApplySweep/RadialGradientStyle]
+  ACpp --> ANode[ArkUINodeApiAdapter.SetNodeSweep/RadialGradient (CAPI)]
+  ANode --> AArkUI
+```
